menu "Kiosk screen"

    config UI_ENROL_NAME
        string "Name the board button enrols under"
        default "Nhân viên 1"
        help
            The board button is the fallback path for adding a face, and NVS key
            device/enrol_name overrides this at run time.

    config UI_MIN_BRIGHTNESS
        int "Lowest backlight percent the slider or a stored value can set"
        range 1 50
        default 10
        help
            A dark panel cannot be read to turn it back up, so neither the
            settings slider nor ui/brightness from NVS goes below this.

    config UI_SEED_BRIGHTNESS
        int "Backlight percent a kiosk starts life at"
        range UI_MIN_BRIGHTNESS 100
        default 100
        help
            Seeds NVS ui/brightness on first boot, the way svc_vision seeds its
            thresholds. The settings slider owns the key after that (KEHOACH 6.2.1).

    config UI_SEED_VOLUME
        int "Speaker percent a kiosk starts life at"
        range 0 100
        default 70
        help
            Seeds NVS ui/volume on first boot. Only the door chime uses it, so a
            quiet office can take it to zero without losing a refusal message.

endmenu
